WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.760
Final episode.

00:01.760 --> 00:04.200
After teams, moments and method,

00:04.200 --> 00:06.399
the last shift from resource

00:06.399 --> 00:08.960
management to a workforce digital

00:08.960 --> 00:09.920
twin.

00:09.921 --> 00:11.961
Business needs now change faster

00:11.961 --> 00:14.481
than any annual plan and AI is

00:14.481 --> 00:16.760
transforming the tasks themselves.

00:16.760 --> 00:18.681
Writing went from pencil to

00:18.681 --> 00:21.801
keyboard to voice. Same goal, new

00:21.801 --> 00:24.401
task, new skill. We can no longer

00:24.401 --> 00:26.681
manage people as static resources.

00:26.681 --> 00:28.120
We need a living model of our

00:28.120 --> 00:30.161
workforce to simulate possible

00:30.161 --> 00:31.001
futures.

00:31.002 --> 00:32.682
On the productivity side, the twin

00:32.682 --> 00:34.362
shows which tasks AI will

00:34.362 --> 00:36.402
transform and which skills will

00:36.402 --> 00:38.401
emerge or decline. So, we make

00:38.401 --> 00:39.802
decisions faster. With more

00:39.802 --> 00:41.761
agility, we staff fluid

00:41.761 --> 00:43.521
high-performing teams.

00:43.521 --> 00:45.002
We transfer knowledge at risk

00:45.002 --> 00:47.162
before experts retire and we

00:47.162 --> 00:49.082
compare the return of each option

00:49.082 --> 00:50.802
with data we control.

00:50.963 --> 00:53.123
On the cultural side, done well,

00:53.123 --> 00:54.963
the twin augments employees. It

00:54.963 --> 00:56.963
does not replace them. They see

00:56.963 --> 00:58.323
how their tasks will change so

00:58.323 --> 01:00.043
they can learn and grow instead

01:00.043 --> 01:01.923
of fearing AI.

01:01.923 --> 01:03.602
But this requires bold change

01:03.602 --> 01:05.402
leaders who think globally, lead

01:05.402 --> 01:07.803
with AI and new generations.

01:08.084 --> 01:10.004
But our HR systems see job

01:10.004 --> 01:12.444
titles, individual skills, and org

01:12.444 --> 01:13.643
charts.

01:13.643 --> 01:15.083
Below the surface are the weak

01:15.083 --> 01:17.483
signals, tacit knowledge, team

01:17.483 --> 01:19.964
dynamics, and engagement. Without

01:19.964 --> 01:22.044
them, a workforce digital twin

01:22.044 --> 01:24.444
cannot mirror the real organization

01:24.444 --> 01:26.044
or simulate how it reacts to

01:26.044 --> 01:26.724
change.

01:26.965 --> 01:28.965
Beyond HR, this data already

01:28.965 --> 01:31.605
exists. No extra data entry for

01:31.605 --> 01:32.605
employees.

01:32.766 --> 01:34.806
The workforce digital twin connects

01:34.806 --> 01:36.325
these signals and learns their

01:36.325 --> 01:38.046
dependencies in a governed and

01:38.046 --> 01:39.726
transparent way.

01:39.726 --> 01:41.526
The goal is to see the work, not

01:41.526 --> 01:43.406
to watch the people.

01:43.406 --> 01:45.886
Without trust, employees shareless

01:45.886 --> 01:47.806
and the data becomes poor or even

01:47.806 --> 01:49.805
deliberately distorted.

01:49.805 --> 01:51.566
With trust, the twin helps

01:51.566 --> 01:53.446
knowledge flow and improves

01:53.446 --> 01:55.926
decisions in every area from daily

01:55.926 --> 01:57.805
project staffing to strategic

01:57.805 --> 01:59.126
workforce simulation.

01:59.127 --> 02:01.207
In practice, the twin collect

02:01.207 --> 02:03.567
signals from the field, engagement,

02:03.567 --> 02:06.966
skills, attrition, program risks,

02:06.966 --> 02:09.927
always aggregated, never individual.

02:09.927 --> 02:11.846
When a deviation appears, we

02:11.846 --> 02:13.846
simulate corrective actions,

02:13.846 --> 02:16.927
upskill, higher, redeploy or use

02:16.927 --> 02:18.607
AI agents.

02:18.607 --> 02:20.646
We no longer predict one future,

02:20.646 --> 02:22.927
we simulate several and we correct

02:22.927 --> 02:23.967
the trajectory.

02:24.288 --> 02:26.288
four shifts,

02:26.288 --> 02:28.767
one new operating system.

02:28.767 --> 02:31.448
Each one addresses productivity and

02:31.448 --> 02:34.687
culture at the same time. Soon,

02:34.687 --> 02:37.208
AI will be available to everyone.

02:37.208 --> 02:39.128
What will make the difference is

02:39.128 --> 02:40.808
the human layer we build around

02:40.808 --> 02:41.648
it.

02:41.648 --> 02:43.087
More human,

02:43.087 --> 02:44.608
more digital,

02:44.608 --> 02:46.288
not a trade-off

02:46.288 --> 02:47.168
and

02:47.169 --> 02:48.529
Thank you for following this

02:48.529 --> 02:49.209
series.
